【来源2】{"claim": "Andrew has been looking for a dog to adopt since the last conversation, browsing websites, visiting shelters, and asking friends.", "attributes": {"status": "active", "assertion": "stated", "local_override": false, "origin": "compressed_memory"}, "source_events": [{"speaker": "Andrew", "role": "user", "occurred_at": "2023-05-06T10:47:00+00:00", "text": "Andrew: [Image: a photography of a dog looking through a cage at the camera] Hey! Since we last spoke, I've been looking for a doggo to adopt - browsing websites, visiting shelters and asking friends of theirs. It's been both fun and annoying!", "context_only": false}], "provenance": "resolved"}
【来源3】{"claim": "Andrew advises that the size of living space and the exercise needs of the breed are important when considering getting a dog.", "attributes": {"status": "active", "assertion": "stated", "local_override": false, "origin": "compressed_memory"}, "source_events": [{"speaker": "Andrew", "role": "user", "occurred_at": "2023-05-06T10:47:00+00:00", "text": "Andrew: Meeting all these adorable pups has been awesome! For those considering getting a pup, the size of living space and the exercise needs of the breed are important. For me, a person living in an apartment, a smaller dog would be best, but if one is active, consider getting one that loves to play and run.", "context_only": false}], "provenance": "resolved"}
【来源4】{"claim": "Andrew plans to check out another shelter soon.", "attributes": {"status": "active", "assertion": "planned", "local_override": false, "origin": "compressed_memory"}, "source_events": [{"speaker": "Andrew", "role": "user", "occurred_at": "2023-05-06T10:47:00+00:00", "text": "Andrew: Haha I can't wait. I'll ttyl, gotta check out another shelter soon.", "context_only": false}], "provenance": "resolved"}
【来源5】{"claim": "Andrew finds the dog adoption search both fun and annoying.", "attributes": {"status": "active", "assertion": "stated", "local_override": false, "origin": "compressed_memory"}, "source_events": [{"speaker": "Andrew", "role": "user", "occurred_at": "2023-05-06T10:47:00+00:00", "text": "Andrew: [Image: a photography of a dog looking through a cage at the camera] Hey! Since we last spoke, I've been looking for a doggo to adopt - browsing websites, visiting shelters and asking friends of theirs. It's been both fun and annoying!", "context_only": false}], "provenance": "resolved"}
【来源6】{"claim": "Audrey adopted another puppy named Pixie.", "attributes": {"status": "active", "assertion": "stated", "local_override": false, "origin": "compressed_memory"}, "source_events": [{"speaker": "Audrey", "role": "user", "occurred_at": "2023-04-02T14:42:00+00:00", "text": "Audrey: [Image: a photo of a small white dog sitting on a carpet] Hey Andrew, I got a surprise for you! We adopted another puppy called Pixie. She's SO cute! Isn't she just the cutest?", "context_only": false}], "provenance": "resolved"}
【来源7】{"claim": "Audrey wants to see her dogs' happy faces even when they are not with her.", "attributes": {"status": "active", "assertion": "stated", "local_override": false, "origin": "compressed_memory"}, "source_events": [{"speaker": "Audrey", "role": "user", "occurred_at": "2023-04-16T16:19:00+00:00", "text": "Audrey: I've always had a strong bond with them – they make me so happy, and I just want to see their happy faceseven when thry're not with me.", "context_only": false}], "provenance": "resolved"}
